{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Royal Lord&quot;, you are a Lord and can build the kingdom of your dreams!  You need to build city walls, assign jobs to villagers, recruit soldiers, repel hordes of monsters at night, and expand your village during the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up a temporary camp</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this perilous kingdom continent, you need to select a place with abundant resources to set up your camp to ensure that you have sufficient resources for future development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/b9c030c3972fc4a065dfb1837a2bbe1c.poster.avif?t=1761915723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/b9c030c3972fc4a065dfb1837a2bbe1c.webm?t=1761915723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/b9c030c3972fc4a065dfb1837a2bbe1c.mp4?t=1761915723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage the kingdom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to recruit new villagers through the camp, build farmland.  Villagers can work in the farmland to obtain food.  They can also build logging and quarries to obtain resources on the map.  Having abundant resources is the first step to building your army.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/de224185f16b3948382dfda97d589b67.poster.avif?t=1761915723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/de224185f16b3948382dfda97d589b67.webm?t=1761915723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/de224185f16b3948382dfda97d589b67.mp4?t=1761915723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch an attack on the enemy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After having sufficient resources, we can build our own army to explore the forest.  There are many monsters in the forest, but they also carry some resources.  Defeating them can obtain the resources carried by the monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/768afb3565a8667d20eced7199793706.poster.avif?t=1761915723\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/768afb3565a8667d20eced7199793706.webm?t=1761915723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/extras/768afb3565a8667d20eced7199793706.mp4?t=1761915723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675700?t=1761915723","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/53af40b2c876b78d955db8ff630716c45cf399df/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761915723","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/b83297ee4921675a2ca1c7f2140c10eaad268e83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761915723","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675700/b83297ee4921675a2ca1c7f2140c10eaad268e83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761915723","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":